## 6. First deploy

From your machine, with the dev profile from step 3:

```bash
databricks bundle validate -t dev --profile dev
databricks bundle deploy -t dev --profile dev
```

The first deploy creates the schema and the `artifacts` volume in `{{ .input_project_name }}_dev`. The MLflow experiment is created under `/Shared/{{ .input_project_name }}/dev` with the volume as artifact location.

After this, pushes to `main` deploy to staging via CI/CD, and tags matching `v*` deploy to prod.

